==Russian==

===Proper noun===
{{ru-proper noun|Кири́лл|m-an}}

# {{given name|male|lang=ru}}, cognate with [[Cyril]].
# Saint [[Cyril]] (Apostle to the Slavs and inventor of the [[Glagolitic]] alphabet, which served as the basis for the [[Cyrillic]] alphabet).

